  "body": ">V2.5.7 - Verify that if OTP or multi-factor authentication factors are lost, that evidence of identity proofing is performed at the same level as during enrollment.\r\n\r\nIf the application implements OTP or multi-factor authentication, the requirements of V2.5.7 is really important.\r\nAnd V2.5.7 can be verified with DAST.\r\n\r\nI think this item should be verified in L1.",
